{"id":2063,"level":80,"name":"Комбінація (5)","group":"Комбінації","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Combinations are the most powerful moves in chess. They often involve multiple tactical themes or a sham sacrifice. Sometimes, you must temporarily sacrifice material to ultimately achieve a significant gain. The ultimate goal of a combination is usually to gain material. By recognizing tactical patterns and thinking ahead, you can find sequences of moves that completely surprise your opponent.</span></p><p><br></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":101,"examples":[{"fen":"1r4k1/p1rq1bpp/2pb1p2/2pp1P2/3Pn2N/1PPBP3/P3Q2P/3RBRK1 w - - 0 22","pgn":"22. Bxe4 dxe4 23. dxc5 Bxc5 24. Rxd7 * ","text":"<p><br></p><p>D-вертикаль наповнений фігурами. Білі можуть скористатися цим, спочатку розмінявши слона, а потім захопивши пішака на c5. Це створює виграшну зв’язку, що дозволяє білим отримати матеріал.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"3r1r2/5ppk/ppq1p2p/8/P1PR4/1P2QP2/5P1P/4R1K1 w - - 0 27","pgn":"27. Qd3+ Kg8 28. Rxd8 * ","text":"<p>За допомогою вмілого шаху білі створюють багаторазову атаку проти чорної тури.</p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77363,"fen":"3r4/pp2rpkp/1bp3p1/4N3/1P6/1BPb3P/P4PP1/R3R1K1 w - - 0 25","pgn":"{[%csl Rd3,Re7][%evp 0,3,212,228,221,224]} {Q=1} 25. Nxd3 Rxe1+ {Q=2} 26. Nxe1 * ","format":27,"texts":["Розглянемо форсування.","Розглянемо форсування."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77366,"fen":"6k1/pp5p/5Pb1/5B2/3P4/4r3/PP4PP/5R1K b - - 0 29","pgn":"{[%csl Rf1,Rf5,Rh1][%evp 0,3,-166,-174,-29997,-29998]} {Q=1} 29... Bxf5 30. Rxf5 {Q=2} Re1+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Розрахунок з форсуваннями.","Розглянемо форсування."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77371,"fen":"r4rk1/2qpbppp/p1n1p3/3bP3/P1NP4/1pP3N1/1P2QPPP/R1B2RK1 b - - 0 16","pgn":"{[%csl Rc4,Rd4][%evp 0,3,-64,-68,-69,-69]} {Q=1} 16... Nxd4 17. cxd4 {Q=2} Bxc4 (17... Qxc4) * ","format":27,"texts":["Погано захище